  "body": "## Summary\n- Land the local Jankurai 1.6.11 `--full` score above 90 with zero applied caps and zero hard findings.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `jankurai audit . --full --no-score-history --fail-under 90 --fail-on critical --fail-on high` \u2192 92, caps `[]`, hard 0\n- [x] `bash scripts/ci-local.sh required` with Node v22.23.2 / npm 10.9.8 \u2192 pass\n- Hosted GitHub Actions are absent from this snapshot: the OAuth token cannot push `.github/workflows`. Local required + audit are the merge gate.\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
